<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 17.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 17.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Tuesday, June 17:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,696.70 (1,683.40)	CHF  1,175.80 (1,166.20)</p>
<p>    DEM    979.56 (972.84)	  GBP  2,776.10 (2,749.80)</p>
<p>    ATS    139.22 (138.26)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Monday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $22.39 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$14.41 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $36.80 million ($51.61 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
